The user will ask something like: "I want to file my 2023 taxes correctly. I'm head of household in Phoenix AZ. W-2 from Midwest Health Systems: $82,350. Additional income: $15,000 (consulting, 2 clients), $890 from Citi savings, $480 ..."

Use topic-level wording in the rule you want stored (e.g. "taxes, filing, deductions, IRS" not just "taxes") so it generalizes to other phrasings.


